{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXERTION - DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exertion is a <strong>rogue-like side-scroller</strong> set in a dystopian future where AI-controlled war machines dominate the battlefield. As a high-tech combat robot, you must fight through relentless waves of hostile drones, each equipped with deadly abilities. Adapt, upgrade, and refine your combat skills to survive the escalating challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ABILITIES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies to unlock <strong>powerful upgrades</strong> and enhance your combat skills. Experiment with different combinations to create a playstyle that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/abilities.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>CARD SELECTION</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of upgrade cards after each battle. Will you focus on raw firepower, enhanced mobility, or tactical defense? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/Card2.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>BOSS BATTLES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for <strong>epic showdowns</strong> against massive war machines. Each boss has unique attack patterns that will test your reflexes and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/Boss.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>EXPLORE THE MAP</strong></u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through enemy-infested corridors and uncover new areas. Stay alert for hidden threats and strategic points that can turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/Map.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>CHOOSE YOUR WEAPON</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your weapon, offering unique advantages and playstyle adaptations in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/Weapons.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the demo and dive into the action! Unlock powerful new weapons, complete challenging quests, and develop your character to progress further with each attempt. Your feedback will help shape the future of <i>Exertion</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530650?t=1740679079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530650?t=1740679079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/4ba447b407f8870b71373a41d72aaf0133d94bf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740679079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/4ba447b407f8870b71373a41d72aaf0133d94bf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740679079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXERTION - DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exertion is a <strong>rogue-like side-scroller</strong> set in a dystopian future where AI-controlled war machines dominate the battlefield. As a high-tech combat robot, you must fight through relentless waves of hostile drones, each equipped with deadly abilities. Adapt, upgrade, and refine your combat skills to survive the escalating challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ABILITIES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies to unlock <strong>powerful upgrades</strong> and enhance your combat skills. Experiment with different combinations to create a playstyle that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/abilities.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>CARD SELECTION</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of upgrade cards after each battle. Will you focus on raw firepower, enhanced mobility, or tactical defense? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/Card2.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>BOSS BATTLES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for <strong>epic showdowns</strong> against massive war machines. Each boss has unique attack patterns that will test your reflexes and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/Boss.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>EXPLORE THE MAP</strong></u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through enemy-infested corridors and uncover new areas. Stay alert for hidden threats and strategic points that can turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/Map.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>CHOOSE YOUR WEAPON</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your weapon, offering unique advantages and playstyle adaptations in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/extras/Weapons.gif?t=1740679079\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the demo and dive into the action! Unlock powerful new weapons, complete challenging quests, and develop your character to progress further with each attempt. Your feedback will help shape the future of <i>Exertion</i>!</p>","developers":["FlatCityGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3164600","name":"Exertion"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530650/header.jpg?t=1740679079","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098200,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steams